60,3,1,talk,Midori,,"Candidates are A: Home Follow-Up, B: Day Rehab, C: Chronic Care, D: Perinatal.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,D seems strongest. It uses stable midwifery staff and is on-site.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Misaki,,I support D. The staffing review shows midwifery has the capacity.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shion,,"D is on-site, so it bills at standard rates. It is financially sound.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shizue,,D can use existing midwifery facilities. It fits our infrastructure best.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Midori,,A is risky due to no tariff for home visits. C is slow due to data issues.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"B is good, but therapy staffing is weak. D is more stable.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Misaki,,B relies on physiotherapists who are leaving. D relies on stable midwives.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shion,,"B is on-site, but D has better staffing stability. I prefer D.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shizue,,B needs new rooms. D can use existing space. D is less disruptive.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Midori,,I am convinced. D is the only one that balances finance and staffing.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,Agreed. D is the most sustainable option based on our findings.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I will vote for D. The staffing data is clear.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shion,,I will vote for D. It meets the financial criteria.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I will vote for D. It fits the hospital's current capacity.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
